hich you have brought to us, came in to me to mock me:", "words": [[0, 141946], [4, 142070], [8, 142190], [14, 142490], [17, 142730], [21, 142890], [31, 143190], [34, 143450], [40, 143650], [47, 144130], [55, 145482], [59, 145590], [66, 145850], [75, 146230], [81, 146510], [85, 146670], [90, 146790], [98, 147010], [101, 147270], [105, 147550], [110, 147817], [113, 148083], [116, 148350], [119, 148570], [122, 148730], [127, 148990]]}, {"verse": 18, "start": 149768, "end": 156073, "text": "And it came to pass, as I lifted up my voice and cried, that he left his garment with me, and fled out.", "words": [[0, 149768], [4, 149888], [7, 149968], [12, 150248], [15, 150448], [21, 151348], [24, 151528], [26, 151668], [33, 151968], [36, 152188], [39, 152328], [45, 152608], [49, 152788], [56, 153488], [61, 153668], [64, 153888], [69, 154108], [73, 154328], [81, 154648], [86, 154868], [90, 155068], [94, 155268], [99, 155568]]}, {"verse": 19, "start": 156353, "end": 166446, "text": "And it came to pass, when his master heard the words of his wife, which she spoke to him, saying, After this manner did your servant to me; that his wrath was kindled.", "words": [[0, 156353], [4, 156504], [7, 156604], [12, 156824], [15, 157044], [21, 157444], [26, 158004], [30, 158184], [37, 158624], [43, 158904], [47, 159064], [53, 159364], [56, 159544], [60, 159664], [66, 160344], [72, 160534], [76, 160724], [82, 161004], [85, 161244], [90, 161624], [98, 162415], [104, 162695], [109, 163035], [116, 163375], [120, 163615], [125, 163815], [133, 164175], [136, 164435], [140, 165058], [145, 165181], [149, 165301], [155, 165621], [159, 165841]]}, {"verse": 20, "start": 166796, "end": 173858, "text": "And Joseph’s master took him, and put him into the prison, a place where the king’s prisoners were bound: and he was there in the prison.", "words": [[0, 166796], [4, 166934], [13, 167454], [20, 167694], [25, 168034], [30, 168274], [34, 168494], [38, 168674], [42, 168814], [47, 168974], [51, 169094], [59, 